 man, maybe 40s, with tattooed arms heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","DeShawn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Alfredo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Dmitri heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 DeShawn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","📓 Codex: First link formed with Thornfield. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","👥 Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Aroha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Lena waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","👥 DeShawn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Alfredo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Spool: Feed it nothing. It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence. (Olivia lived to tell it, twice — the village 