nebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","◈ THE TABLE IS SET. A ring of pale light waits — take your seat from Haven when you are ready. Nothing is final until you sit.","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Hannah heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""],"anchoredLines":[{"day":20,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Dustboar. It's here."},{"day":25,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — The Big Stare. It's here."},{"day":33,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Extended Warranty. It's here."},{"day":56,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — The Eulogy. It's here."},{"day":59,"line":"🗺️ Scouts found its lair — tile 8,4. THE HERALD — the sky, getting bigger. It is WAITING. You cannot face it alone. Sound the call."},{"day":59,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Emberhold in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":64,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 2,140 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":68,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Ad Break. It's here."},{"day":69,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 2,310 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":74,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Emberhold in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":75,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — The Herald. It's here."},{"day":78,"line":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."},{"day":78,"line":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."},{"day":78,"line":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."},{"day":79,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Thornfield in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 1,860 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":86,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Buffering. It's here."},{"day":89,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 2,170 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":89,"line":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."},{"day":91,"line":"\"THE HERALD came. Named and located — the war council knew its face. They faced Big-Eyes and lived to sit here. They faced The Loud Beast and lived to sit here. 2 more of the later drafts faced besides. Even now the wave-5 bar reads: blood your fighters (1 of 2 veterans).\" — the System is still reading the list."}],"instrumentTranscripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-first","day":78,"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"instrumentErrors":[],"interceptorErrors":[],"travelErrors":[],"mtErrors":[],"maxWave":4,"wave4":1,"wave5":0,"w4Day":48,"w5Day":null,"national":1,"table":1,"won":1,"days":91,"gameDays":91,"endReason":"over-other","endOmen":{"stage":2,"day":59},"endLinks":3,"endPend":false,"endPendMid":null,"deaths":[{"day":